# JM_Bioretention: John McCormack Road CC-101
# Units: SI; all lengths/elevations are metres.
# Local vertical datum: partial-height outlet crest = 0.0 m.
# JM grid: nx=4, nz=5 material layers, primary_cells=20
# JM blocks: soil=20, aggregate_storage=8, surface=1, surrounding_soil=12
